  "reason": "No genuine defect found; the single 'looked away' is earned, unclustered, and fits the voice.",
  "text": "She asked the mountain for her brother back. For a long moment the wind moved in the high grass and nothing answered. Then the old woman who tended the shrine looked away, and in the looking-away the girl heard the answer she had come so far to refuse."
}
